ction I.G"},{"animation":false,"id":144,"name":"Pony Canyon"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"Kurumi's heart was broken by the sudden death of her boyfriend in a tragic airplane accident.​ Forced to carry on without her beloved Hal,​ she fell into a reclusive and joyless existence.​ Kurumi had given up on the world,​ but a brilliant scientist devised a plan to win her back.​ By melding futuristic technology with the binary equivalent of human emotion,​ they created an ultra-lifelike robotic surrogate to take Hal's place – and lure Kurumi from her shroud of solitude.​\n\nResistant at first,​ this shattered beauty slowly yielded to her feelings of longing – and took comfort in the company of a robot.​ Though their unique bond grew stronger with each passing day,​ Kurumi and Hal would soon discover that nothing about their artificial love story was quite as it seemed.​\n\n(Source: Funimation)"},"tags":[{"name":"Rehabilitation","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Robots","rank":98,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Amnesia","rank":91,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":87,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Artificial Intelligence","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":58,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":46,"spoiler":false},{"name":"CGI","rank":25,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Hal","english":"Hal","native":"ハル","romaji":"Hal","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"春"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Haru"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"京都爱情故事"}]},"trailer":{"id":"OS43cCcWU0A","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/OS43cCcWU0A/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}